enamelpin-by-suricrasiaonline (1.0+git20200705-0ddebs3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches/02_portable-entry-point.patch : replace the x86-64
    _start entry point and raw syscalls with main() and _exit(), so the
    demo builds on every architecture
  * debian/patches/01_adapt_makefile.patch : fixed DEP-3 header
  * debian/control : Architecture any, removed unused build dependencies
    (nasm, pax-utils, python3-minimal), added libgl-dev, rewritten
    description
  * debian/copyright : upstream has no license, use public-domain
    (probably freeware), added smol, vondehi and shader_minifier.exe
  * debian/resources : added the missing icon (made from the upstream
    screenshot)
  * debian/enamelpin-by-suricrasiaonline.6.md : fixed example and
    program name, documented the progressive rendering
  * debian/README.Debian : added
  * debian/source/lintian-overrides : override for the upstream Windows
    Shader Minifier
  * debian/enamelpin-by-suricrasiaonline.lintian-overrides : override for
    the pandoc manual page
  * debian/upstream/metadata : removed the non-standard References field
  * debian/resources/enamelpin-by-suricrasiaonline.desktop : added
    Keywords

